      "vertical_alignment": "top",
      "body": "Top: an association scan, each marker at its position against -log10(padj), peaks over the dashed threshold labelled; lasso markers to filter by feature. Bottom: the same kind in rainfall mode on one tumour genome, y is log10 of the distance to the previous SNV, so the three kataegis foci (C to T and C to G runs) drop as vertical streaks. Colour-by and the mode sit in each header. Inputs: GWAS or QTL summary statistics, and the somatic VCF of nf-core/sarek.\n",
